   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Practice question: correlation\n",
    "\n",
    "The **sample correlation** between $(X_1,...,X_n)$ and $(Y_1,...,Y_n)$ is given by \n",
    "\n",
    "$$r = \\dfrac{\\sum \\limits_{i=1}^n (X_i - \\overline{X})(Y_i - \\overline{Y})}{\\sqrt{\\sum \\limits_{i=1}^n (X_i - \\overline{X})^2} \\sqrt{\\sum \\limits_{i=1}^n (Y_i - \\overline{Y})^2}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $\\overline{X}$ and $\\overline{Y}$ are the sample means.\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.callout-tip}\n",
    "## Question\n",
    "\n",
    "Create the following two series in `pandas`:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "e82c7ee1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: false\n",
    "x = pd.Series([2.0, 2.5, 7.0, 9.5])\n",
    "y = pd.Series([-1.0, 3.0, 0.5, 0.9])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "9b4946a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0    2.0\n",
       "1    2.5\n",
       "2    7.0\n",
       "3    9.5\n",
       "dtype: float64"
      ]
